        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.tshaonline.org/handbook/entries/desdemona-tx"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Texas Central Railroad arrived in 1881, giving local farmers a vital market link.",
